@startuml
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #3333C4
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #FFFFFF
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Homework filter over the current student view (no save)
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic #3333C4
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser #3333C4
participant "filter:HomeworkFilterCommand" as Filter #3333C4
participant "m:ModelManager" as Model #9D0012

[-> Logic : execute("hw filter 1 s/MATH due/2026-10-15")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(...)
activate Parser
note over Parser, Filter : HomeworkCommandParser delegates to HomeworkFilterCommandParser.\nThe parser validates student, subject, exact due date and status\nand creates a filter command. Short dates use the injected Clock.
Parser --> Logic : filter
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : current data
note over Logic : Copy data into a snapshot.
Logic -> Filter : execute(m)
activate Filter
Filter -> Model : getStudentList()
activate Model
Model --> Filter : displayed students
deactivate Model
note over Filter, Model : Validate the optional displayed student index.\nTraverse selected students and homework in insertion order.\nApply every supplied criterion (AND), including explicit status.\nInclude past dates; scores do not imply completion.\nRetain original student and homework indices in result lines.
Filter --> Logic : CommandResult (matches or no matches)
deactivate Filter
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : unchanged data
note over Logic : Data equals snapshot: no storage call.\nStudent filtering and sorting remain unchanged.
[<-- Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Logic
@enduml
